{
  "uid": "monitor-sre-overview",
  "title": "服务表现 · 四个黄金信号",
  "description": "服务表现优先，资源压力用于定位。真实入口 HTTP 与本机探测分开解释；缺失值保留为空，不补造接入前的数据。",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai",
  "refresh": "3s",
  "tags": [
    "server-monitor",
    "sre",
    "provisioned"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Google SRE · 监控分布式系统",
      "url": "https://sre.google/sre-book/monitoring-distributed-systems/",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "type": "link"
    }
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "3s",
      "15s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "入口服务",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "个人网站 : website,学习白板 : whiteboard,Study Agent : study-agent",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "resolution",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "3s,5m,30m",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "3s",
          "value": "3s"
        },
        "options": [],
        "hide": 2,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "先看服务表现，再看资源压力",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "monitor-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "暂无数据",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "暂无样本",
                  "color": "#8e8e8e"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**延迟 · 流量 · 错误 · 饱和度**　成功和失败请求分开观察，优先定位实际症状。\n\n入口指标来自本站 Nginx 的真实离散 HTTP 请求，排除监控自身、健康探测和长连接。这里只展示观测结果，尚未定义业务 SLO，也未配置外部通知。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "延迟 · 成功请求 P95",
      "description": "过去5分钟2xx/3xx请求的P95；跨服务先合并直方图桶，再计算分位数。没有请求或采集失败时不显示0ms。",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "monitor-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "monitor-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(1000 * histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) ((server_monitor:http_success_duration_seconds_bucket:rate5m{service=~\"$service\"} and (timestamp(server_monitor:http_success_duration_seconds_bucket:rate5m{service=~\"$service\"}) == scalar(max(timestamp(server_monitor_http_recorded_at_seconds{host_id=\"cloud-primary\"})))) and on () (max(server_monitor_http_recorded_at_seconds{host_id=\"cloud-primary\"}) > time() - 9) and on () (max(timestamp(server_monitor_http_recorded_at_seconds{host_id=\"cloud-primary\"})) > time() - 9))))) and on () ((max(up{job=\"server-monitor-http\",host_id=\"cloud-primary\"}) == 1) and (time() - max(timestamp(up{job=\"server-monitor-http\",host_id=\"cloud-primary\"})) < 45))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "noValue": "暂无数据",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "暂无样本",
                  "color": "#8e8e8e"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "流量 · 每秒请求",
      "description": "近1分钟平均真实入口请求速率。零流量只是没有观察到请求，不等于服务健康。",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
